\emph default
\bar default
\strikeout default
\uuline default
\uwave default
\noun default
\color inherit
, we apply L'hopital's Rule to the equation for 
\begin_inset Formula $p^{*}$
\end_inset

 to find that the equilibrium price approaches constant marginal cost as
 
\begin_inset Formula $I\rightarrow\infty$
\end_inset

, i.e., 
